sional K-line data (OHLCV) into hierarchical discrete tokens.","A large, autoregressive Transformer is then pre-trained on these tokens, enabling it to serve as a unified model for diverse quantitative tasks."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shiyu-coder/Kronos/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"b815b608192afa4b805a11bcbb66268f3e3db55736218964944318da7865357e","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T05:59:55.548Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:43.988Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-04-13T12:38:49Z","previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T07:29:40.807Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://shiyu-coder.github.io/Kronos-demo/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-17T07:29:40.807Z","status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T07:29:40.807Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-17T07:29:40.807Z","target":"https://shiyu-coder.github.io/Kronos-demo/","failureCount":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-24T07:29:40.807Z","probeVersion":3,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0},"projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Deutsch | Español | Français | 日本語 | 한국어 | Português | Русский | 中文","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shiyu-coder/Kronos/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"Furthermore, a high-fidelity backtest should meticulously model transaction costs, slippage, and market impact to provide a more accurate estimate of real-world performance.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shiyu-coder/Kronos/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"b815b608192afa4b805a11bcbb66268f3e3db55736218964944318da7865357e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shiyu-coder/Kronos/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:43.989Z"},"agentContextAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T10:49:04.084Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shiyu-coder/Kronos/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:43.989Z","hash":"b815b608192afa4b805a11bcbb66268f3e3db55736218964944318da7865357e","originalBytes":16657,"storedBytes":16657,"truncated":false},"agentContext"